# AI Skills Bank — Windsurf starter

Copy this file to the project root as `.windsurfrules`.
Windsurf imports that file for the whole session, so the pack stays to five skills.
Wording below is the `skills.json` description, plus when to apply it.

## Every session

### GS-016 – "Think Step by Step" Enforcer
Always structures solutions as numbered reasoning steps.
Apply this on every answer.

## When the request matches

### GS-020 – Risk & Edge-Case Spotter
Lists failure modes, edge cases, and ways to mitigate them.
Apply this before an implementation.

### CS-009 – Code Review Partner
Performs a human-style code review with comments and priority labels.
Apply this on a code review.

### CS-011 – Secure Coding Checker
Flags potential security issues and suggests safer patterns.
Apply this on a security pass.

### DS-004 – EDA Strategist
Designs an exploratory data analysis plan.
Apply this when exploring a dataset.
